        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/gta-week-maniac-header.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>What would you get if you combined the chaotic top-down action of old-school <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/games/grand-theft-auto-2\">Grand Theft Auto 2</a> with the chaotic top-down action of Vampire Survivors? That's the question Soldat and King Arthur's Gold developer Transhuman asked when it started working on 2024's roguelite shooter Maniac. The result is a delight, yet Maniac remains frustratingly underappreciated.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/grand-theft-auto-6-vampire-survivors-maniac-interview\">Read more</a></p>",
