        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/gta-6-headline-launch-gallery-4.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Did anything notable happen this week? Not that I can remember. The weather was quite rainy - will that do? I'm just being silly, of course. We've had - and I suppose are still having - an historic week in video games, as <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/gta-6-walkthrough\">Grand Theft Auto 6</a> arrives. It's dominated everything and I fear it's going to dominate this article too. But a reminder: next week is our \"Not-GTA Week\", so we'll be making a concerted effort to talk about games, probably smaller games, that aren't Godzilla blockbusters.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/what-weve-been-playing-its-slow-its-awkward-its-weird-and-its-hard\">Read more</a></p>",
